<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατείβω</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλείβω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let
				flow down, shed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί νυ δάκρυ κατείβετον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.86
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>flow apace</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλερὸν δὲ κατείβετο δάκρυ παρειῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.794
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κατειβόμενον Στυγὸς
			ὕδωρ</span> Styx's <i>downward flowing</i> water, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.185
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατείβετο δὲ γλυκὺς
				αἰών</span> life <i>was flowing, passing away</i>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				152
			</span></i>: rare in 
				Att.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δάκρυον
			κατείβεται</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				127
			</span></i> (paratrag.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			trans., <i>flood, overflow</i>, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρος κατείβων καρδίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					36
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>overflow with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκερῇ
				κατείβετο θυμὸν ἀνίῃ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.290
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατείβετο θυμὸς ἀκουῇ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1131
			</span></i>.</div>
